  "body": "`liveAgentRunning`, `openPencilRunning` and `newMaxRunning` (internal/agent/liveagent.go:133, openpencil.go:124, newmax.go:123) ask this machine's processes. A test that turns magpie on for every agent (TestSyncKeepsAnAddressOnAnotherMachine, TestListOnlyAgentsReadConnected, TestReverseProxyIsStillMagpie) is refused for that agent whenever LiveAgent, OpenPencil or NewMax is open on the test machine.\n\nSeen with OpenMausBot's guard of the same shape: an OpenMausBot server open on mote turned those three tests red:\n\n```\n--- FAIL: TestSyncKeepsAnAddressOnAnotherMachine (1.36s)\n    lan_kept_test.go:48: openmausbot: OpenMausBot writes its engines back over what magpie writes now: quit OpenMausBot, then try again\n--- FAIL: TestListOnlyAgentsReadConnected (1.17s)\n    listonly_test.go:115: openmausbot: ...\n--- FAIL: TestReverseProxyIsStillMagpie/nginx, /local\n    proxy_kept_test.go:94: openmausbot: ...\n```\n\nThe OpenMausBot commit holds `ombRunning` false in the agent package's TestMain. The other three need the same, with their own tests setting it where they test the refusal.\n",
  "closed_by": null,
